        "introduction": "I am Yuri Volkov, leader of the Crimson Imperium. I overthrew a monarchy that believed itself untouchable, and I will not allow my nation to be brought to its knees again. We prefer stability to chaos, strength to empty promises, and peace secured by mutual respect to war born of arrogance. Let us determine whether our nations can prosper side by side. I assure you, I intend to protect mine.",
        "afterPeace": "Let the guns fall silent; the Imperium has better things to build than ruins.",
